<title>HONG KONG: Pak Fah Yeow 1996 net down 8.64 pct.</title>
<headline>Pak Fah Yeow 1996 net down 8.64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   23.5  vs  25.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    8.0   vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs  3.71 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    30.61 vs  33.51</p>
<p>    Turnover		     93.67 vs  87.45</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pak Fah Yeow International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 17-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Pak Fah Yeow is a medicated oil manufacturer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 14 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of six cents) vs 14 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
